    "updated_at": "2021-08-11T02:35:48Z",
    "body": "Sorry for the inactivity. I originally planned to implement it, but due to an implementation issue specific to Chrome isReloadNavigation implementation is harder than isHistoryNavigation, and I haven't had time to implement it.\r\n\r\nI'm OK with removing it given nobody has implemented it.",
